...@../../../dev/d2/themes/sequence
# W04: one legal race outcome, with abort winning the authoritative CAS.
shape: sequence_diagram
coord: Coordinator
issuer: Grant authority
ledger: Admission ledger
broker: Rust broker
coord -> ledger: Record ConsumePending\nBind the exact command and attempt
coord -> issuer: Consume the original signed grant
issuer -> issuer: Remove the pending grant
coord -> coord: Treat consumption as unknown\nThe response timed out
coord -> ledger: Try AbortNoDispatch CAS\nNo claim may exist
ledger -> coord: Confirm that abort is committed
issuer -> coord: Return a late success receipt
coord -> ledger: Try to commit the original attempt\nKeep its original correlation
ledger -> coord: Reject the terminal attempt
coord -> broker: Report status only\nIssue no send handle
broker -> broker: Block dispatch\nRequire SendCommitted and a valid claim
ledger.rule: "If the abort reply is lost, read the recorded command outcome first.\nIf a claim wins first, refuse both abort and refund."

# Shared role accents; brand marks are confined to architecture headers.
coord.class: runtime
issuer.class: policy
ledger.class: ledger
broker.class: runtime
ledger.rule.class: note

